      "source": [
        "**Answer 5 (why fit scaler on training data only):**\n",
        "The scaler must learn its mean and standard deviation from the training data only. If it were fit on all the data, information about the test set would leak into training, and the test score would look better than the model's real performance. The test set must behave like unseen future customers, so it is only *transformed* using the statistics learned from the training set."
      ],
      "id": "1u5pvuS1Wsq_"
